{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me start by studying the upstream harness and related files as instructed.\n\nKey things to read:\n1. cloudflare-os/packages/integration-tests/README.md\n2. src/harness.ts\n3. src/network-interceptor.ts\n4. src/rpc-client.ts\n5. package.json (exports map)\n6. docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-15-full-code-mode-and-gatekeepers.md Task 3.2, 3.1, 3.3, section 6\n7. cloudflare-os/packages/workshop-evals/package.json and its imports\n\nAlso need to look at:\n- Our outer gatekeeper packages at packages/gatekeeper-snowflake and packages/gatekeeper-nvidia (their wrangler.jsonc)\n- The kernel's workshop-backend dir (cloudflare-os/packages/workshop-backend?) and its wrangler.jsonc\n- Sibling packages' tsconfig for mirroring\n\nLet me do a bunch of parallel reads/commands first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bf70ac58526c4520bbf7cba0","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"ls C:/Users/mchay/cloudflare-os-starter && echo --- && ls C:/Users/mchay/cloudflare-os-starter/packages && echo --- && ls C:/Users/mchay/cloudflare-os-starter/cloudflare-os/packages"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9a91b8bd29db4d0286b85b22","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:/Users/mchay/cloudflare-os-starter/cloudflare-os/packages/integration-tests/README.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"cf-rest","model":"@cf/zai-org/glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":13279,"output":290,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":13825,"cost":{"input":0.00199185,"output":0.000145,"cacheRead":0.00000768,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00214453}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789538972655,"responseId":"id-1789538978091","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
